<title>USA: Primmadonna Q4 oper shr falls to $0.12.</title>
<headline>Primmadonna Q4 oper shr falls to $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>PRIMM, Nev. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  Q4	  1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.12		    $0.15</p>
<p> Oper net		   3,600		    4,600</p>
<p> Revs			48,129		   58,409</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,145		   30,808</p>
<p>					   YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.81		    $0.76</p>
<p> Oper net		  24,800		   23,300</p>
<p> Revs		     234,935		  239,797</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,535		   30,801</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 oper shr exlcudes 12.3 million in pre-tax, one-time charges. Including charges, the company reported a Q4 1996 net loss of $4.4 million, or $0.15/shr, and a year 1996 net profit of $16.7 million, or $0.55/shr.</p>
</text>
